{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Render-scenario matrix for tests/render_baseline.py (change: refactor-automation-and-sample-scenes, tasks 8.2-8.4). Scene/camera/time/UI parameters live in tests/lua/render_scenario.lua; this file carries the runner-side configuration: backends, tolerances, masks, temporal checks and preconditions. Baselines are stored per backend under tests/baselines/<backend>/<scenario>.png and are only written by the explicit update operation.",
